     <h2>Built by David Gallaher</h2>
     <p>David is an experienced firefighter, paramedic, driver/operator instructor, and fire/EMS educator. FireOpsSim grew from a simple goal: make practical training tools easier for firefighters and instructors to use on a phone, tablet, or station computer.</p>
     <p>The tools are designed to support training discussions, classroom practice, and station drills. They are not a replacement for certified instruction, department SOPs, manufacturer guidance, adopted codes, or the authority having jurisdiction.</p>
+    <p>For EMT and paramedic patient assessment, vitals practice, EMS career guidance, and clinical scenarios, use the sister site <a href="https://emscodesim.com/" rel="noopener">EMSCodeSim</a>. FireOpsSim stays focused on fire service tools and career stages; EMSCodeSim stays focused on medical learning.</p>
   </article>
